   Stas, Michiel; Aerts, Raf; Van Orshoven, Jos; Somers, Ben, Katholieke Univ Leuven, Div Forest Nat \& Landscape, Dept Earth \& Environm Sci, Celestijnenlaan 200E-2411, BE-3001 Leuven, Belgium.
